+<div class="callout crit"><b>The verification is the vulnerability.</b> The literal code is:
+<pre class="code"><code>if ((v3_15 == null) || ((v3_15.getStatus() == null) || (!v3_15.getStatus().equals("ok")))) {
+    v1_16 = "false";
