+<article class="vuln card" id="CRYP-01" data-sev="Critical" data-cat="Cryptography" data-search="cryp-01 keyless static cipher used for all &amp;ldquo;encrypted&amp;rdquo; local secrets cryptography com.bumptech.glide.d.p() / .q() apply a fixed four-stage transform with no key material whatsoever: xor every byte with 0x6c ; rotate each byte left by 3; reverse the whole buffer; xor byte i with (i*37) ^ 0xa5 . it was re-implemented in python and round-trips perfectly. this single routine protects the instagram password, the bearer token, the 2fa seed and every sensitive sharedpreferences value. obfuscation marketed as encryption. anyone who pulls the apk or merely a backup decrypts every secret offline in microseconds, with no key-recovery step at all. com.bumptech.glide.d.p()/q() ; verified by report/cipher_poc.py (round-trip ok for passwords, bearers, totp seeds and urls) use androidx.security.crypto.encryptedsharedpreferences / encryptedfile with an androidkeystore master key, or sqlcipher for room.">
