+    <div class="fixcol"><h4>Remediation</h4><p>Strip unreferenced literals at link time (<code>-ffunction-sections</code> + <code>--gc-sections</code>). Do not leave dead crypto identifiers in a shipped binary; they cannot be distinguished from live ones by an auditor.</p></div>
