++    <div class="fixcol"><h4>Remediation</h4><p>Do not ship cryptographic primitives that no documented interface reaches, and do not ship a cipher whose exact algorithm cannot be validated without the live object layout. Either expose it through an auditable, standards-conformant API with a rotatable key, or remove it. Publish the key-management story for whatever remains.</p></div>
