++<li><b>CRED-01 / CRED-02 &mdash; passwords and TOTP seeds at rest.</b> <code>instagram_accounts.u_w</code> and <code>two_factors.u_p</code>/<code>s_k</code> in an unencrypted SQLite file behind a keyless cipher.</li>
