+============================================================================
+ libtopfollow.so (arm64-v8a) — NATIVE STRING DECRYPTION, RUN FOR REAL
+============================================================================
+ Target : work/apk/lib/arm64-v8a/libtopfollow.so  (1,805,400 bytes = 1.72 MiB)
+ SHA-256: a60bcf064d0907072712a16398968d2f50c6802fc0d56fb60139030a98701a04 (APK)
+ Method : the strings are NOT protected by a native "sub_128A0 blob decryptor".
+          They are protected by a single-byte XOR applied at each reference site
+          (keys 0x55 and 0x5A), plus nested base64 for a handful. This file is
+          produced by work/native_string_decrypt.py sweeping both keys over the
+          whole image and keeping the meaningful runs in the .rodata string
+          region [0x118b0, 0x1ab5b). No device is required; this is the actual
+          set of strings the app de-obfuscates at runtime.
+
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ WHY THERE IS NO sub_128A0 STRING DECRYPTOR (the claim, tested)
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ Claim : "native decryptor at sub_128A0 takes encrypted blob + key, called 200+
+          times in JNI_OnLoad, decrypts 204 URLs."
+ Reality: 0x128A0 is NOT code. Section map of this .so:
+            .text    VA [0x2d2ac, 0x1b1bbc)   <- executable code starts here
+            .rodata  VA [0x118b0, 0x1ab5b)    <- read-only DATA
+          0x128A0 lies inside .rodata, exactly 16 bytes before the AES forward
+          S-box at 0x128B0. The bytes there are:
+            0x128a0: 7b cb b0 b0 a8 fc 54 54 6d d6 bb bb 2c 3a 16 16
+            0x128b0: 63 7c 77 7b f2 6b 6f c5 30 01 67 2b fe d7 ab 76   <- S-box
+          i.e. 0x128A0 is table data, not an instruction. There is no function
+          there to hook, and no 204 encrypted URLs. The real URL count is small
+          (enumerated below) and they are XOR-obfuscated, not blob-encrypted.
+
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ GENUINE DECRYPTED SECRETS  (XOR key 0x55)
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ category                 offset       decrypted value
+ -----------------------  ----------   ------------------------------------------------
+ backend base URL         0x176de      https://top.nivafollower.app/v840/
+ ServerCheck endpoint     0x172d0      https://nivafollower-app.com/api-v3/topfollow_check.php
+ Instagram API v1 base    0x1762c      https://i.instagram.com/api/v1/
