+ CRYPTO THE PROMPT CLAIMS — TESTED — *ABSENT FROM THE NATIVE LIBRARY*
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ claim                                    status    evidence
+ ---------------------------------------  --------  ---------------------------
+ white-box AES, 2 MB table in .rodata     ABSENT    .rodata is 37,547 bytes TOTAL
+                                                    (0.036 MiB); only 3 high-entropy
+                                                    4 KiB windows exist (the two
+                                                    S-box pages + the 549-byte
+                                                    whitening table @0x13b30). A
+                                                    2 MB T-box table is impossible.
+ custom ChaCha / Salsa20                  ABSENT    no "expand 32-byte k" constant,
+                                                    no 61707865/3320646e sigma words
+ PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA512 (native)              ABSENT    no "PBKDF2"/"HmacSHA"/"sha512"
